  "body": "## Summary\n- open one authoritative SQLite database on the NAS from every desktop and remove the local replica/sync path\n- make cross-process writes observable through a shared revision, with immediate transactions and last-commit-wins behavior\n- add immutable `stable` and `dev` NAS distribution channels with verified local installs and rollback state\n- remove the sync UI/API surface and update the repo architecture documentation\n\n## Feature contracts\n- `round-and-advance`: round selection and mutation now operate directly against the shared database; an active round stays immutable, while later reads observe the latest committed state\n- `desktop-status`: status exposes the authoritative database path and revision; sync/startup-sync state is absent\n- `desktop-distribution`: publishing is complete-before-visible, manifests identify immutable bundles, clients verify size and SHA-256 before activation, and stable/dev channels remain explicit\n\n## Proof\n- `cargo test --workspace --locked` (72 core + 21 desktop tests)\n- `npm run build` (includes frontend tests)\n- `cargo build --release -p shows-desktop`\n- PowerShell parser validation for all three distribution scripts\n- fake NAS publish/install/launch integration exercised locally\n- release binary copied to `D:\\Downloads\\shows\\shows-desktop.exe` without launching",
  "changed_files": 20,
